#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2
msgid "API v3"
msgstr "API v3"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Read the Docs API uses :abbr:`REST (Representational State Transfer)`. "
"JSON is returned by all API responses including errors and HTTP response "
"status codes are to designate success and failure."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs API 使用 :abbr:`REST (Representational State Transfer)` 。所有 API "
"响应（包括错误）均返回 JSON，HTTP 响应状态码用于指示成功与失败。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:12
msgid "Table of contents"
msgstr "目录"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:15
msgid "Authentication and authorization"
msgstr "认证与授权"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:17
msgid ""
"Requests to the Read the Docs public API are for public and private "
"information. Endpoints that return public information do not require "
"authentication."
msgstr "对 Read the Docs 公共 API 的请求可涉及公开或私有信息。返回公开信息的端点无需认证。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:22
msgid "Token"
msgstr "令牌"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:24
msgid ""
"The ``Authorization`` HTTP header can be specified with ``Token <your-"
"access-token>`` to authenticate as a user and have the same permissions that"
" the user itself."
msgstr ""
"可在 ``Authorization`` HTTP 头中指定 ``Token <your-access-token>`` "
"以用户身份认证，获得与该用户相同的权限。"

