msgid "|org_brand|"
msgstr "|org_brand|"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:34
msgid ""
"On |org_brand|, you will find your access Token under `your profile settings"
" <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/tokens/>`__."
msgstr ""
"在 |org_brand| 上，你可以在 `个人设置 <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/tokens/>`__"
" 中找到你的访问令牌。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:37 ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:98
msgid "|com_brand|"
msgstr "|com_brand|"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:41
msgid ""
"On |com_brand|, you will find your access Token under `your profile settings"
" <https://app.readthedocs.com/accounts/tokens/>`__."
msgstr ""
"在 |com_brand| 上，你可以在 `个人设置 <https://app.readthedocs.com/accounts/tokens/>`__"
" 中找到你的访问令牌。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:46
msgid "Session"
msgstr "会话"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:48
msgid ""
"Session authentication is allowed, so the API can be used by our dashboard "
"and other internal services."
msgstr "允许会话认证，因此 API 可供我们的仪表盘及其他内部服务使用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:51
msgid "Rate limiting"
msgstr "速率限制"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:53
msgid ""
"The API limits unauthenticated requests to 5 per minute and authenticated "
"requests to 60 per minute. The :ref:`build <api/v3:Builds>` and build "
"notification endpoints allow 120 authenticated and 30 unauthenticated "
"requests per minute, so the build page can poll them while a build runs."
msgstr ""
"API 将未认证请求限制为每分钟 5 次，已认证请求限制为每分钟 60 次。:ref:`构建 <api/v3:Builds>` 与构建通知端点允许每分钟"
" 120 次已认证和 30 次未认证请求，以便构建页面在构建运行时轮询它们。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:59
msgid ""
"Authenticating your API requests with a :ref:`token <api/v3:Token>` also "
"bypasses most other rate limiting, including network-level blocks that may "
"affect automated scripts accessing Read the Docs from cloud providers or CI "
"environments. If your script is getting ``403 Forbidden`` responses, adding "
"an ``Authorization: Token <your-access-token>`` header is the recommended "
"solution."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`令牌 <api/v3:Token>` 认证 API 请求还能绕过大多数其他速率限制，包括可能影响从云提供商或 CI 环境访问 Read"
" the Docs 的自动化脚本的网络层封锁。如果你的脚本收到 ``403 Forbidden`` 响应，建议添加 ``Authorization: "
"Token <your-access-token>`` 头来解决。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:64
msgid "Pagination"
msgstr "分页"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:66
msgid ""
"All endpoints that return a list of objects are paginated. By default, 10 "
"objects are returned per page, but you can change this using the ``limit`` "
"query parameter. The response includes a ``count``, ``next``, and "
"``previous`` attributes to navigate between pages."
msgstr ""
"所有返回对象列表的端点都会分页。默认每页返回 10 个对象，但你可以使用 ``limit`` 查询参数更改。响应包含 ``count`` "
"、``next`` 和 ``previous`` 属性用于在页面间导航。"

