"``latest`` and ``stable``."
msgstr "你无法更改由 Read the Docs 管理的版本的 slug，例如 ``latest`` 和 ``stable`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:718
msgid "Builds"
msgstr "构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:720
msgid ""
"Builds are created by Read the Docs whenever a ``Project`` has its "
"documentation built. Frequently this happens automatically via a web hook "
"but can be triggered manually."
msgstr "每当 ``Project`` 的文档被构建时，Read the Docs 就会创建构建。这通常通过 webhook 自动发生，也可手动触发。"

