msgstr "为此项目创建重定向。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:1317
msgid ""
"``type`` (required) can be one of ``page``, ``exact``, ``clean_url_to_html``"
" and ``html_to_clean_url``."
msgstr ""
"``type`` （必需）可以是 ``page`` 、``exact`` 、``clean_url_to_html`` 和 "
"``html_to_clean_url`` 之一。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:1318
msgid "Depending on the ``type`` of the redirect, some fields may not be needed:"
msgstr "根据重定向的 ``type`` ，某些字段可能不需要："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:1320
msgid "``page`` and ``exact`` types require ``from_url`` and ``to_url``."
msgstr "``page`` 和 ``exact`` 类型需要 ``from_url`` 和 ``to_url`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:1321
msgid ""
"``clean_url_to_html`` and ``html_to_clean_url`` types do not require "
"``from_url`` and ``to_url``."
msgstr ""
"``clean_url_to_html`` 和 ``html_to_clean_url`` 类型不需要 ``from_url`` 和 "
"``to_url`` 。"

