msgid ""
"``position`` (optional, default: ``0``) - Order of execution. Position "
"starts at 0 and is used to order redirects."
msgstr "``position`` （可选，默认：``0`` ）-- 执行顺序。位置从 0 开始，用于给重定向排序。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:1324
msgid ""
"``force`` (optional, default: ``false``) - Apply the redirect even if the "
"page exists."
msgstr "``force`` （可选，默认：``false`` ）-- 即使页面存在也应用重定向。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:1325
msgid "``enabled`` (optional, default: ``true``) - Enable or disable the redirect."
msgstr "``enabled`` （可选，默认：``true`` ）-- 启用或禁用重定向。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:1326
msgid "``description`` (optional) - A description for the redirect."
msgstr "``description`` （可选）-- 重定向的描述。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:1327
msgid ""
"``http_status`` (optional, default: ``302``) - HTTP status code, can be "
"``301`` (permanent) or ``302`` (temporary)."
msgstr "``http_status`` （可选，默认：``302`` ）-- HTTP 状态码，可以是 ``301`` （永久）或 ``302`` （临时）。"

