"These variables are used in the build process when building your "
"documentation. They are for example useful to define secrets in a safe way "
"that can be used by your documentation to build properly. Environment "
"variables can also be made public, allowing for them to be used in PR "
"builds. See :doc:`/environment-variables`."
msgstr ""
"环境变量是你可以为项目定义的变量。构建文档时，这些变量会在构建过程中使用。例如，它们可用于以安全方式定义机密，供文档构建时使用。环境变量也可以设为公开，从而允许在"
" PR 构建中使用。参见 :doc:`/environment-variables` 。"

