msgstr "返回指定 VCS 提供方（ ``github`` 、``gitlab`` 或 ``bitbucket`` ）的远程组织"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2126
msgid "Remote repositories"
msgstr "远程仓库"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2128
msgid ""
"Remote repositories are the importable repositories connected via "
"``GitHub``, ``GitLab`` and ``Bitbucket``."
msgstr "远程仓库是通过 ``GitHub`` 、``GitLab`` 和 ``Bitbucket`` 连接的可导入仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2133
msgid "Remote repository listing"
msgstr "远程仓库列表"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2138
msgid "Retrieve a list of all Remote Repositories for the authenticated user."
msgstr "获取已认证用户的所有远程仓库列表。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2241
msgid "The ``results`` in response is an array of remote repositories data."
msgstr "响应中的 ``results`` 是远程仓库数据数组。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2243
msgid "return remote repositories containing the name"
msgstr "返回名称包含指定字符串的远程仓库"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2244
msgid ""
"return remote repositories containing the full name (it includes the "
"username/organization the project belongs to)"
msgstr "返回全名包含指定字符串的远程仓库（全名包含项目所属的用户名/组织名）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2245
msgid ""
"return remote repositories for specific vcs provider (``github``, ``gitlab``"
" or ``bitbucket``)"
msgstr "返回指定 VCS 提供方（ ``github`` 、``gitlab`` 或 ``bitbucket`` ）的远程仓库"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2246
msgid ""
"return remote repositories for specific remote organization (using remote "
"organization ``slug``)"
msgstr "返回指定远程组织（使用远程组织 ``slug`` ）的远程仓库"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2247
msgid ""
"Add additional fields in the response. Allowed values are: "
"``remote_organization``. Multiple fields can be passed separated by commas."
msgstr "在响应中添加额外字段。允许的值：``remote_organization`` 。多个字段可用逗号分隔传递。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2255
msgid "Embed"
msgstr "嵌入"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2259
msgid ""
"Retrieve HTML-formatted content from documentation page or section. Read "
":doc:`/guides/embedding-content` to know more about how to use this "
"endpoint."
msgstr "从文档页面或片段获取 HTML 格式内容。阅读 :doc:`/guides/embedding-content` 了解如何使用此端点。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2264
msgid ""
"The content will be returned as is, without any sanitization or escaping. "
"You should not include content from arbitrary projects, or projects you do "
"not trust."
msgstr "内容将原样返回，不做任何清理或转义。你不应包含来自任意项目或你不信任项目的内容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2284
msgid "URL of the document."
msgstr "文档的 URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2285
msgid "fragmet part of the URL used to query the page."
msgstr "URL 中用于查询页面的片段（fragmet）部分。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2286
msgid "HTML content of the section."
msgstr "片段的 HTML 内容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2287
msgid "whether or not the page is hosted on Read the Docs or externally."
msgstr "页面是托管在 Read the Docs 上还是外部。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2289
msgid "full URL of the document (with optional fragment) to fetch content from."
msgstr "要获取内容的文档完整 URL（可选带片段）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2290
msgid ""
"*optional* documentation tool key name used to generate the target "
"documentation (currently, only ``sphinx`` is accepted)"
msgstr "*可选* 用于生成目标文档的文档工具键名（目前仅接受 ``sphinx`` ）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2291
msgid ""
"*optional* documentation tool version used to generate the target "
"documentation (e.g. ``4.2.0``)."
msgstr "*可选* 用于生成目标文档的文档工具版本（例如 4.2.0 ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2292
msgid "*optional* CSS selector for the main content of the page (e.g. ``div#main``)."
msgstr "*可选* 页面主内容的 CSS 选择器（例如 div#main ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/api/v3.rst:2296
msgid ""
"Passing ``?doctool=``, ``?doctoolversion=`` and ``?maincontent=`` may "
"improve the response since the endpoint will know more about the exact "
"structure of the HTML and can make better decisions."
msgstr ""
"传递 ``?doctool=`` 、``?doctoolversion=`` 和 ``?maincontent=`` 可能改善响应，因为端点能更了解 "
"HTML 的确切结构并做出更好的决策。"

